# mkdocs output, plus the pages that the Pages workflow stages into docs/ from
# skills/axiomize and examples/ before building, via
# .github/scripts/stage_docs.py. Generated on every build, never authored.
#
# `docs/adaptive-workflow.md` was missing from this list. The Pages workflow
# has always copied that file into docs/, but because it was not ignored a local
# staging run left it staged and untracked -- and one is about to be committed by
# accident, which would then be a hand-edited copy of a file that already exists
# in skills/axiomize/. Every page the staging script writes is listed here.
site/
docs/rigor.md
docs/archetypes.md
docs/adaptive-workflow.md
docs/skill.md
docs/examples.md

# Local build artifacts (wheels/sdists are produced by CI, never committed).
dist/
build/

# Local coverage/pytest artifacts (CI measures coverage, never commits it).
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
# Scoped to the repository root: the bare `cov*.txt` pattern also matched
# .github/coverage-floor.txt, which is a committed CI gate, and silently
# excluded it from every commit.
cov*.txt
!/.github/coverage-floor.txt
!/.github/mypy-baseline.txt
